    <origin>Found 2026-08-26 by task 080 while reconciling task 074's endpoint-file census after merging 285 commits of master. The census forced classification of two new route-registering files; reading one of them surfaced this. NOT found by any route inventory — the file did not exist when the four prior enumerations ran.</origin>
    <revision>REWRITTEN 2026-08-26 after the escalation trigger fired and the owner chose **option B (classify the caller)**. The prior version prescribed option A (`tid` must match) which BREAKS the shipped L2 probe — see `notes/task-081-tenant-diagnostic-BLOCKED.md`. Two factual errors in the intervening handoff are corrected in `background` § WHAT ALREADY EXISTS; do not carry them forward.</revision>
