      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Endpoints/Diagnostics/TenantContainerResolverEndpoint.cs — the gate + the two stale doc claims (class summary line 32-33; `WithDescription` line 59-61)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Logging/AuditEnrichmentMiddleware.cs — `IsOnBehalfOfFlow` becomes a thin call to the new primitive; ONE classifier, two consumers</file>
      <file role="reference">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/Handlers/E2EAcceptance/SpeContainerResolverInvariantProbe.cs — the caller that must keep working. DO NOT EDIT (another project's active worktree)</file>
      <file role="reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Filters/TenantAuthorizationFilter.cs — the existing tenant-match filter; option A. Read it to understand why it is not the answer here</file>
